  <item>
    <title>029：年末大赏一塌糊涂！KPOP追忆杂谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693993ae37f52a644e41765d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693993ae37f52a644e41765d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Dec 2025 20:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>MAMA收视率史低、AAA遇上政治口碑下跌，最近的KPOP总有「小事发生」</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《大约有鱼》我们从近期的热门事件聊起，探讨了从二代到六代的KPOP审美变化，公司及概念营销的变迁，追忆了那些年我们为MAMA舞台疯狂的青春！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容纯属朋友之间的杂谈追忆，无恶意拉踩，有个人喜好，如有冒犯，并非故意~</span></p><span></span><p><span>👦🏻嘉宾：宁噶宁噶（KPOP专业十级，前MCN从业者）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你会听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🐟Part1：近期KPOP圈热门事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 金冬天和田柾国恋情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> AAA盛典ADP成员公开台独发言引发争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> XG女团成员Cocona官宣自己切除胸部跨性别为男</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🐟Part2：概念营销</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 二代开始风格蓝海，公司引领审美、概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 从TWICE的转型之路聊KPOP概念审美变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a> ITZY和APINK转型失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> NIMIXX关于「拼接」的概念和世界观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> Aespa的元宇宙、IVE的自恋小公主、Lesserafim的热血感、NewJeans的美国青少年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> KPOP开始闯美、开拓多元市场故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> CORTIS的爆火：歌曲制作、成员能力、真实反叛、时尚审美、公司营销</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐟Part3：KPOP的衰弱和追忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> 爱豆团体不再精心编排年末舞台、大赏含金量降低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> MAMA曾经充满竞争和冲劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> 舞台推荐：权志龙freestyle diss MAMA主办方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3477">57:57</a> 少女时代小分队活人感用心改编舞台《the boys》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">1:00:16</a> F(x)和4minute交换舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">1:02:03</a> 2NE1最后一个MAMA完整体惊喜舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">1:06:35</a> TroubleMaker舞台亲嘴震惊全世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你听得开心，生活愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
