  <item>
    <title>018：骂编剧没用！为啥国产剧总一言难尽？聊点影视剧幕后故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659bb1816d045a7f5ead337e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659bb1816d045a7f5ead337e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jan 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年了，回首这一年热播的剧，跟新嘉宾一起聊聊观剧感受、背后故事、制作过程和未来趋势。</span></p><p><span>👧🏻嘉宾介绍：参与IP全链路开发、制作、营销的小水老师</span></p><p><span>🐟</span><strong><span>Part1：聊聊热播剧</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 《繁花》将金宇澄对白式原著用影像呈现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 非典型王家卫的非线性叙事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 《漫长的季节》大型时代变迁里的个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> &nbsp;由《鸣龙少年》的不克制聊到《漫长》的克制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 影视剧为了热搜点不得不掺杂话题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 平台过会只要「前五集剧本」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> 骂编剧没用！其实编剧说了不算</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 《我的人间烟火》男性主导所以内容畸形</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> &nbsp;《以爱为营》S级IP+S级演员+S级流行元素的爆款公式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a> 观众美誉度其实并不重要</span></p><p><span>🐟</span><strong><span>Part2：国产剧制作及未来趋势分享</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 集体创作以方便分摊风险，也是怕背锅的一种妥协</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">33:52</a> 更符合语境的内容和古装、悬疑、个人传奇作品值得期待</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> 做恋恋剧场、迷雾剧场的IP有用吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 如何判断一部剧会好还是会扑？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 平台如何为影视剧分配资源？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">47:06</a> 观众记住内容和主角＞记住撕逼的花边新闻</span></p><p><span>🐟</span><strong><span>Part3：优质内容推荐和延伸</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2904">48:24</a> 小水推荐《拾荒者统治》《蓝眼武士》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 韩剧日剧的引领在于资源高度集中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> 国产剧是非专业的所有人都要下场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3281">54:41</a> 大悦沉迷玩《原神》的分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3458">57:38</a> 大悦N刷《步步惊心》</span></p><p><span>本期希望大家听得开心、生活愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
