  <item>
    <title>016：在王者峡谷抓甲方确认工作，文娱行业乙方血泪史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652e69e8fe7441729231c141</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652e69e8fe7441729231c141</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>秋招季想进文娱行业避坑必听节目（我自封的）</span></p><p><span>失踪人口终于回归！本期《大约有鱼》聊的是文娱行业幕后工作经验&amp;故事分享。</span></p><p><span>分享甲乙双方双视角的从业血泪史和真诚建议。</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>👧🏻格格：老北京资深北漂，互联网营销学徒，坚持唯物的唯心主义爱好者，一个人生经历偏少的苍白女性</span></p><p><span>【你会听到】</span></p><p><strong><span>🐟Part1：入行经历</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 格格大学生兼职文案宣传</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> &nbsp;乙方营销公司都有啥工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大悦大学学财务发出痛苦的爆鸣声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;营销行业最喜欢fancy的简历</span></p><p><strong><span>🐟Part2：工作故事</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> &nbsp;为什么要做营销宣传？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> &nbsp;格格团队拿下项目的宝贵经验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> &nbsp;比稿时乙方突然唱歌or大哭怎么办</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;上线前一天还在改brief</span></p><p><strong><span>🐟Part3：血泪史吐槽</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;乙方团队看着大悦一个人干活的炸裂故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;乙方剪艺人视频用对家应援色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;格格兼职把两位男艺人照片放反导致世纪大战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a> &nbsp;给某艺人写了37个脚本全被否定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a> &nbsp;某艺人工作室内部混乱、一言堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">49:05</a> &nbsp;某艺人占拍摄场地导致超时，乙方买单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3016">50:16</a> &nbsp;格格在王者峡谷抓甲方回消息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3103">51:43</a> &nbsp;甲方PUA是压力转移还是权利展示</span></p><p><strong><span>🐟Part4：发散聊聊行业和建议</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3286">54:46</a> &nbsp;卫视、长视频、短视频、艺人团队的服务标准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3577">59:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;熬大夜、高强度加班的工作量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3735">1:02:15</a> &nbsp;营销变味、电影营销再次被嘲的行业趋势</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3793">1:03:13</a> &nbsp;现在营销的钱越来越难花/赚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3835">1:03:55</a> 永远不要给自己设限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">1:08:39</a> 避免为爱发电，每一份劳动都有价值</span></p><p><span>本期希望大家听得开心、生活愉快！</span></p>]]></description>
